| any pixel width (''"px"'' suffix optional)

|-
| height
| none
| any pixel height (''"px"'' suffix optional)

|-
| align
| right
| left, center, right, none

|-
| caption position
| bottom
| top, bottom

|-
| triangle
| none
| triangle, none

|-
