| #ff0080
| any CSS color

|-
| class
| (none)
| Use <code>skin-invert-image</code> for SVG images that need to be inverted for dark mode

|}

== Examples ==

The triangle parameters give the option to add a colored triangle label—
{{plain image with caption|James Webb Space Telescope Mirror37.jpg|caption=This is a picture of the [[James Webb Space Telescope]].|align=left|caption position=top|triangle=triangle|triangle color=rgba(0,110,255,1)|upright=2}}
<syntaxhighlight lang="wikitext" inline>{{plain image with caption|James Webb Space Telescope Mirror37.jpg|caption=This is a picture of the [[James Webb Space Telescope]].|align=left|caption position=top|triangle=triangle|triangle color=rgba(0,110,255,1)|upright=2}}</syntaxhighlight>

